# Your Compute Needs

I am Benjamin Starostka Jakobsen, the P1 compute coordinator, and this survey is how I get to know
the people using our partitions. I want to hear what you are actually trying to run, what you need
from HPC, and where the current systems get in your way. Entirely optional.

